{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e0b79c0b-5569-8c64-a678-d67a1830a4ad",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T15:03:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about the snow plowing. I'm at 102 Memorial Boulevard, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 102 Memorial. Got it. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:00:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the plow came through, I think Tuesday, and it only did one pass. It left a pile at the end of the driveway and the street's still narrow. I asked my neighbor and she said they only came the one time, and then I said, well, that's what I thought."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so one pass, pile at the end of the driveway, narrow street. I'm writing that down. Are you wanting a plow to come back out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:01:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. If somebody could come back and widen it out, that'd be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a request for 102 Memorial Boulevard to get a second pass. Is the street itself still covered or is it mostly the edges?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the edges. The middle's clear, but cars can't really park along the side. [pause] Oh, and that's the other thing. When does the snow parking ban lift? I wasn't sure if it was still on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check on that. [pause] Okay, so the ban's tied to the storm declarations. Once the city announces it's over, you're good to park on the street again. Right now it shows as lifted, so you can park."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's off already. Good. I called the number last week and she said it'd be posted, and I said I couldn't find it, so that's why I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it gets posted on the city website and the social pages, but it's easy to miss. No problem. Anything else on the plow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, just that it's pretty tight where the pile is. The neighbor's cat sits on our windowsill every afternoon, and it was watching the whole thing, so I know the pile's been there since Tuesday. Sorry, that's random."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. Cat's a good witness. Alright, so I've got a second pass requested, 102 Memorial Boulevard, edges and driveway pile. Do you want a call back, or are you good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be good, in case they can't make it. It's 401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0159. Got it. Crews are working through a list of these, so it might be today or tomorrow, and if anything changes someone will ring you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Beatriz. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T15:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
